NEARS-2774 QA — pre-existing, UNRELATED overflow found during 1.3x text-scale regression
sweep (n_item_card.dart, NOT cart_item_widget.dart — outside this ticket's diff scope).

Device: emulator-5554, 320dp width, EN and AR locale, font_scale=1.3 (OS accessibility
setting, clamped in-app to 1.3 per lib/main.dart:460), UserApp worktree
com.izzes.nears.nears_nears_2774_cart_outer_row_overflow.

Reproduced twice (once per locale) navigating to the Basket screen's "You May Also Like!"
recommendation rail, which renders NItemCard from packages/nears_dls/lib/components/nitemcard/n_item_card.dart:

