Source (n_item_card.dart:543-569): `_infoBlock` wraps a `Column` (mainAxisAlignment:
spaceAround, crossAxisAlignment: start) with a fixed EdgeInsets.all(10) padding around an
optional brandLine Text + a Flexible name Text (maxLines:2) inside a Stack. At the 1.3x
text-scale clamp, the Column's intrinsic height exceeds its parent's constraint by 1.1
logical px — a small, pre-existing DLS-component overflow, NOT part of this ticket's
`cart_item_widget.dart` outer-Row diff (NEARS-2774 scope is confined to
cart_item_widget.dart per QA Test Scope).

Filed as a non-blocking regression_bug (pre-existing, unrelated to this diff) — does not
affect NEARS-2774's PASS/FAIL verdict.
